<summary><b>Evidence</b> — database-backed test, before and after</summary>

- The test below drives the update branch. It fails at `0e38ea7a`: in the "published unstarted experiment" case, `randomization_activated_at` stays null after the sync starts the schedule.
- With the patch, it passes. The `TestServiceSuite` subset `-testify.m=RandomizationActivation|ExposureSchedule|Sync|Rollout|Start` reports 206 `--- PASS` lines and no failures.
