**[P3]** Make Go accept the same timestamps as the edge, which parses with chrono. We want the evaluators to converge on the edge grammar.

`time.Parse(time.RFC3339Nano, …)` and chrono's `parse_from_rfc3339` disagree. chrono accepts lowercase `t` and `z`, a space separator, and second `60`; Go rejects them. Go accepts a comma fraction, offset `+24:00` and a one-digit hour; chrono rejects them.

